---
title: "School of Arts & Sciences"
order: 7
---

The School of Arts and Sciences includes Associate of Applied Science (AAS), Associate of Arts (AA), and Associate of Science (AS) degrees. Additionally, the School of Arts and Sciences offers certain Certificates (C) and Career Studies Certificates (CSC) designed to provide student access to specific educational pursuits.

